    "summary": "Quality gets 'compare' and 'pair' model stages after its chunk stage (adapters/code-review-duplicates.ts), both countAs 'relation' and onCallFailure 'fail-review', with no single calls. compare pairs a chunk's descriptions with every later chunk's, in batches of half of what the limit leaves beside the framing, so each cross-chunk pair is compared once and every call fits; answers name candidates validated against the call's two lists. pair judges each candidate on both full rows when they fit, else full row against description in each direction (a row that cannot fit is named), with today's quality findings; validate rejects a counterpart or location outside the pair. Tests: exact pair coverage and sizes, under-limit no calls, pair rejection then failure, counts under relation including a re-issue.",
